          "number": "0K",
          "brief": "Protect intellectual property rights and access to data generated by farmers, fishermen and foresters",
          "long_description": "Precision agriculture and other technological innovations increasingly rely on large volumes of data collected at the producer level. While agricultural technology providers offer valuable services by processing and analyzing these data, the absence of clear best practices on data protection and valuation raises concerns about potential misuse and unfair practices. Ensuring farmers’ data privacy and confidentiality requires improved governance frameworks that involve all relevant stakeholders. These frameworks should also address challenges related to cross-border data transfers.",
