          "brief": "Improve livestock productivity through better genetics",
          "long_description": "Increasing productivity and reducing GHG emissions per unit of product can be achieved through improved livestock genetics. It is important to select breeds that are well adapted to both current and future climate conditions. At the same time, protecting livestock biodiversity is essential to avoid genetically homogenous animal populations, which could contribute to the emergence and spread of diseases or lead to the overutilization of antibiotics.",
