          "long_description": "Invest in research and development to breed crops that are high-yielding, resilient to pests and diseases, and adaptable to changing environmental conditions. This includes developing drought-resistant, heat-tolerant and pest-resistant varieties. Innovations should favor co-generation and knowledge-sharing approaches between the various stakeholders to address the needs of the farmers, processors, consumers and innovators.",
