              "long_description": "The National Seed Policy calls for seed-sector revitalisation through legal and policy reforms enabling public- and private-sector participation in producing quality planting materials. The enabling environment includes self-regulation and sustainable access to affordable credit, while harmonised regional seed policies and regulations would facilitate cross-border seed trade.",
