          "brief": "Improve productivity of aquaculture and foster guidance on Good Aquaculture Practices (GAPs)",
          "long_description": "Develop and disseminate comprehensive guidelines to ensure sustainable and responsible aquaculture practices. Invest in and adopt fish varieties with improved genetics. Shift to low-GHG feed for aquaculture. Limit the use of antibiotics in aquaculture and rely on solar panels and other renewable sources to power aquaculture installation.",
