          "long_description": "Modernize irrigation systems to align with farmer demand for flexible and reliable water supplies and phase out flood irrigation techniques. Utilize innovative planning, design and evaluation technologies for real water savings per unit of production and reduced soil erosion or salination. This includes the adoption of drip irrigation, precision agriculture, and the reliance on digital agriculture technologies to optimize water use.",
