          "brief": "Improve the coherence of policies across sectors and levels of government to address land- and water-related objectives and ecosystems",
          "long_description": "Decisions made in sectors such as agriculture, environment, finance and planning should consider their impacts on natural resources, including land, water and ecosystems. Improved intersectoral coordination  can help identify overlaps, address trade-offs and improve performance across multiple levels of governments. Strengthening coordination also reduces inefficiencies and costs. It clarifies lines of authority in case of conflict and helps define who is accountable for decisions and actions.",
