              "description": "Landscape restoration",
              "long_description": "The National Agroecology Strategy for Food Systems Transformation 2024–2033 calls for collective action and landscape approaches to restoring ecosystems across all agroecological zones. Critical ecosystems supporting food-system productivity are to be mapped and profiled to guide the design of restoration interventions.",
