          "long_description": "Life-cycle emissions from biofuels and bioenergy can be reduced through the adoption of CCUS technologies and improvements in facilities. Accounting for the full life-cycle carbon intensities of various feedstocks - including carbon-sequestration in soils - can help reduce GHG emissions per liter of biofuel produced.",
