          "brief": "Change agricultural, food and beverage policies to align with prioritization of healthy diets and climate actions",
          "long_description": "Many current agricultural and farm policies still incentivize practices that are harmful to the environment or to people. Efforts to reform and 'repurpose' those policies should redirect financial resources toward research and development, extension services, cash transfers to vulnerable farmers, payments for ecosystem services, and risk management instruments. Support may also be redirected from producers to consumers. As these policies often span sub-sectors and policy domains, rebalancing the full portfolio will require a transversal and coordinated approach.",
