          "number": "9J",
          "brief": "Improve the financial system to reinforce risk management strategies and enhance uptake of investments",
          "long_description": "Create risk-sharing mechanisms to support local lending and micro-credit institutions in extending lending periods, while ensuring compatibility with the broader objectives of the lending institutions. Promote climate-smart investments through the development of specific financial products that are recognized by the market. Develop a macro-level catastrophic insurance scheme through a global risk pooling mechanism to support countries in addressing  risks related to climate, food security, and nutrition. Improve women’s access to financial services, including weather index-based insurance.",
